{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C3\", \"C2\", \"C1\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\"],\n  \"why\": \"总排序：C2最均衡，既保留了主要实质内容，又形成完整的因果推进；C3多保留了内心选择这一细节，但末句略绕；C1则缺少关键理由，且有含混表达。keep：C3略胜C2，因为“只是在心里”更明确地保留了继续喜欢是内心选择、并不意味着已经向对方表态这一层，C2虽表达清楚但这层限定不够显明，C1则漏掉了尊重对方自主心意、不把期待变成对方义务等内容。cover：C2最好，它把尊重对方意愿、回望曾经真实的快乐、接受未来仍会疼痛和决定继续喜欢连成一条因果链，能解释尾声为何既有沉静落定又保留温热；C3基本相同，C1的原因链不够完整。lean：C2各个步骤分工清楚，衔接紧凑；C1虽然短，但第二句含混，且缺少必要的心理连接；C3把最后一个意思拆成两句，略显重复和松散。plain：C2最像一个人在具体地讲自己的经历，意思直接；C3的“只是在心里”“把它收回”稍显绕和含混；C1的“他希望对方是自己愿意靠近”最不自然，也最难确定具体意思。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3ea287ad-6700-4add-bff2-ba50d26b10ec", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T230555296665Z", "elapsed_seconds": 80.578, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:07:15.870581+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "516de1f6611a1b98f02ac38f1301f639a10dbbbd1a405876b160a959f4c41618", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py"